{
  "voice": "Puck",
  "pace": "fast-paced, snappy, clear",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "text": "They say be grateful. Don't ask for more.",
      "style": "confident, a little provocative",
      "at": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "text": "But a raise isn't a reward. It's a price.",
      "style": "sharp, a knowing smile",
      "gap": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "text": "And a price is just a name you put on value.",
      "style": "warm, vivid",
      "gap": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "text": "Beggars hope. Pricers name.",
      "style": "curious, building",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "text": "The work didn't change, only the number you named.",
      "style": "clear, landing the point",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "k1",
      "text": "So stop wondering if you deserve it.",
      "style": "punchy, emphatic",
      "gap": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "text": "Ask the better question.",
      "style": "calm, inviting",
      "gap": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "text": "What value did you create this year, in one number?",
      "style": "curious, direct",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "text": "Name it before they do.",
      "style": "matter of fact, warm",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "text": "Write the number down. Walk in with it.",
      "style": "resolved, practical",
      "gap": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "text": "Problem solved, value paid.",
      "style": "satisfied, confident",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "text": "Worth it.",
      "style": "warm, final, a small smile",
      "gap": 0.15
    }
  ]
}